---
// Dark wing: anatomy of an issue, with CSS mockups instead of screenshots.
---

<section class="wing" id="inside">
  <div class="container wing-inner">
    <div class="status-row">
      <span class="status-label"><span class="pulse-dot"></span> publishing daily</span>
      <span class="status-label">weekdays, 7am PT</span>
    </div>

    <div class="part-header">
      <span class="ghost-numeral" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
      <div class="part-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow kicker">Inside every issue</p>
        <h2 class="part-title">Three parts. Every day.</h2>
        <p class="part-body">
          Each email follows the same shape, so your brain knows where to look. The story, the
          proof, and the take you can act on before standup.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="wide-card">
      <div class="wide-copy">
        <p class="feature-kicker">01 · The brief</p>
        <h3 class="wide-title">The story, in plain words.</h3>
        <p class="wide-body">
          What shipped, who it matters to, and the honest read on whether it changes your week. If
          the answer is no, the issue says so and moves on.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="wide-media">
        <div class="mock-frame">
          <p class="mock-heading">Brief</p>
          <div class="mock-lines">
            <span style="width: 88%"></span>
            <span style="width: 96%"></span>
            <span style="width: 74%"></span>
            <span style="width: 90%"></span>
            <span style="width: 58%"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-callout">
            <span class="mock-callout-label">take</span>
            <span class="mock-callout-text">Worth a spike this sprint, not a rewrite.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="half-card">
        <div class="half-media">
          <pre class="mock-code"><code><span class="c"># receipts, not vibes</span>
<span class="k">def</span> <span class="f">eval</span>(cases):
    scores = [judge(c) <span class="k">for</span> c <span class="k">in</span> cases]
    <span class="k">return</span> mean(scores), ci95(scores)

mean, ci = eval(harness)
<span class="c"># 0.71 [0.64, 0.78]</span></code></pre>
        </div>
        <div class="half-copy">
          <p class="feature-kicker">02 · The receipt</p>
          <h3 class="half-title">Proof you can rerun.</h3>
          <p class="half-body">
            Benchmarks get re-run, snippets get tested, charts get traced back to source. If a claim
            cannot carry a receipt, it does not make the cut.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="half-card">
        <div class="half-media">
          <div class="mock-chat">
            <div class="mock-msg mock-q">should we swap our embedding model?</div>
            <div class="mock-msg mock-a">
              Not yet. Recall holds at 0.84 and the swap costs a full reindex. Revisit after the
              next eval run.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="half-copy">
          <p class="feature-kicker">03 · The take</p>
          <h3 class="half-title">A verdict, not a shrug.</h3>
          <p class="half-body">
            The issue closes with a position you can argue with. Reply if you disagree. The best
            threads in this newsletter started as arguments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .wing {
    z-index: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--navy-light), var(--navy) 55%);
    position: relative;
  }
  .wing::before {
    content: "";
    pointer-events: none;
    background: radial-gradient(900px 480px at 16% 10%, #73b0ff1c, #0000 68%),
      radial-gradient(1200px 720px at 88% 82%, #4c70be24, #0000 72%);
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(#0000, #000 180px calc(100% - 220px), #0000);
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(#0000, #000 180px calc(100% - 220px), #0000);
  }
  .wing-inner {
    z-index: 1;
    padding-top: 34px;
    padding-bottom: 110px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .status-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    padding-bottom: 13px;
  }
  .status-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sheet-ink-tertiary);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .pulse-dot {
    background: var(--sheet-green);
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    animation: pulse-dot 2.6s ease-out infinite;
  }
  .part-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 28px;
    margin-top: 52px;
  }
  .ghost-numeral {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    color: #73b0ff33;
    user-select: none;
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 110px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.8;
  }
  .part-copy {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .kicker {
    color: var(--sheet-blue);
  }
  .part-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    color: var(--sheet-ink);
    text-wrap: balance;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .part-body {
    max-width: 560px;
    color: var(--sheet-ink-secondary);
    text-wrap: pretty;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .feature-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sheet-blue);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .wide-card {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sheet);
    background: #ffffff08;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff1a;
    border-radius: 20px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.82fr) minmax(0, 1.18fr);
    margin-top: 40px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .wide-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 36px 34px;
  }
  .wide-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    color: var(--sheet-ink);
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .wide-body {
    color: var(--sheet-ink-secondary);
    text-wrap: pretty;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .wide-media {
    border-left: 1px solid #ffffff1a;
    min-height: 380px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 30px;
  }
  .mock-frame {
    width: min(380px, 100%);
    background: #ffffff0a;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff1a;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
  }
  .mock-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--sheet-ink-tertiary);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .mock-lines {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .mock-lines span {
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #ffffff14;
  }
  .mock-callout {
    margin-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sheet-hairline);
    padding-top: 14px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .mock-callout-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--sheet-orange);
    flex: none;
  }
  .mock-callout-text {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--sheet-ink);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .half-card {
    background: #ffffff0a;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff1a;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .half-media {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff1a;
    height: 280px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .mock-code {
    width: 100%;
    background: #0a12266e;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff14;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #ffffffc9;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .mock-code .c {
    color: #ffffff6b;
  }
  .mock-code .k {
    color: #bf8fff;
  }
  .mock-code .f {
    color: #73b0ff;
  }
  .mock-chat {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .mock-msg {
    max-width: 88%;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .mock-q {
    align-self: flex-end;
    background: #0a7aff33;
    border: 1px solid #0a7aff4d;
    color: var(--sheet-ink);
  }
  .mock-a {
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: #ffffff0d;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff1a;
    color: var(--sheet-ink-secondary);
  }
  .half-copy {
    padding: 24px 28px 28px;
  }
  .half-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    color: var(--sheet-ink);
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .half-body {
    color: var(--sheet-ink-secondary);
    text-wrap: pretty;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  @media (width <= 860px) {
    .wide-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .wide-media {
      border-top: 1px solid #ffffff1a;
      border-left: 0;
      order: 2;
      min-height: 260px;
    }
    .card-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (width <= 560px) {
    .ghost-numeral {
      display: none;
    }
    .status-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }
  }
</style>
